<title>HONG KONG: Dao Heng Bank places HK$200 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Dao Heng Bank places HK$200 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A HK$200 million six-month floating rate certificates of deposit issue has been privately placed for Dao Heng Bank, said arranger Jardine Fleming Bank.</p>
<p>The certificates were issued at par to float at 10 basis points over the three-month Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>The payment date is March 27.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
